  "description": "Balancing the catlike reflexes and feather weight of Haro M2X MegaMax technology and T-700 carbon with a performance-packed component build, the FLC 29 Expert delivers the ultimate in technology without the ultimate in coin. 100mm travel Rock Shox forks and workhorse Shimano components make the FLC 29 Expert ready to shred the race course or the local singletrack. The only question remains, are you ready to shred with it?\nRock Shox Recon Silver TK 29 Taper, 100mm w/ PopLoc\nFSA Afterburner 38/24 crankset with Press Fit BB92\nShimano SLX front derailleur\nShimano XT rear derailleur\nRitchey Comp 20mm riser bar 31.8mm / Ritchey Comp stem\nShimano SLX 10-speed shifters\nRitchey Comp 2-bolt 31.6mm seatpost\nShimano M-395 brakeset",
